SWFPlayer/Resources/Web/*.wasm
SWFPlayer/Resources/Web/*.map
SWFPlayer/Resources/Web/RUFFLE_VERSION
SWFPlayer/Resources/Web/LICENSE_MIT
SWFPlayer/Resources/Web/LICENSE_APACHE
SWFPlayer/Resources/Web/README.md

